    <string name="onboarding_title">Protect notification previews</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body">RAKSHA AI monitors notification previews that Android exposes after you grant Notification Listener access. Messages, links and attachment hints visible in notifications may be sent to the configured backend for analysis.\n\nRAKSHA AI does not read your complete WhatsApp chat history and does not request unrelated permissions.\n\nBackend or network failure is not safe. Failed analysis is shown as Couldn\'t verify so you can treat it cautiously.\n\nEnable notification access to let RAKSHA AI capture supported WhatsApp notification previews.</string>
